# Breezy Does It (levels/solo/breezy.txt), the Giant Steps route. Fans and floors that won't
# wait: float over the fan dip, hop the crumbling bridge's hole; float on the sewage fans from
# one crumbling stone to the next; hop the headwind bridge; jump up into the vent's gust; hop
# the holes under the ceiling vents (pressed down: jump from the clear spot). At the fork take
# the high lane, crumbling stones a toot apart, call the band (Down; it lands on bar 8, the
# song's first turn) and step into the fan pit: the fan blows twice as far and lifts Nat onto
# the rooftop. Up there: the crumbling bridge, spikes, the gust and a late toot to scoop the
# best nuggets under the spiky ceiling, then a toot over each spike pit (their nuggets mark the
# spot; every toot refills Giant Steps), crumbles over spikes, the drop to the bank. The nerve
# fork: the safe climb (the crumbling ledge, a toot up onto the spiky roof, hop its spikes and
# its crumbling bridge's hole). The shout chorus from the bank on: the last stretch with the
# long-reach fans, the vent's gust, the climb out.
